# Cloudflare Workers static-assets header rules.
#
# The asset server infers Content-Type from the file extension and omits the
# charset. Link-preview fetchers that trust the HTTP header over the document's
# own <meta charset> can then mis-decode the non-ASCII characters in the title
# and description (both carry an em-dash). State the encoding where the parser
# looks for it first.
/
  Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

/index.html
  Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
